     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hello all,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">I am trying to write a longitudinal <span>irt</span> model like below. It has three tests applied at different times with common items across them. Theta among the different time is correlated. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/mirt-package/attach/139cea37df4da0/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"462\" height=\"369\"><br></div></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">I wrote my mirt model like below using the constraint keyword to indicate anchor itens. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\">model &lt;- mirt.model(&#39; T1 = 1-30</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  T2 = 31-60</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  T3 = 61-90</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  CONSTRAIN = (21-30, a1), (31-40, a1)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  CONSTRAIN = (21-30, d), (31-40, d)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  CONSTRAIN = (51-60, a1), (61-70, a1)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  CONSTRAIN = (51-60, d), (61-70, d)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">  COV = T1*T2*T3&#39;</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">)</div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\">mirt.2PL = mirt(U, model, itemtype = &#39;2PL&#39;)  # <span style=\"font-size:small\"></span></div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">I get the following error. Where is my mistake? Any ideas?</div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Error: Constraint applied to fixed parameter(s) 181 187 193 199 205 211 217 223 229 235 301 307 313 319 325 331 337 343 349 355 361 367 373 379 385 391 397 403 409 415  but should only be applied to</div><div class=\"gmail_default\">                 estimated parameters. Please fix!</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Looking forward to hearing from you,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hugo</div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473029016000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jI8DsBxlwyWHwDqv7UeG7\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk3Ee8Wg4ibOcS9FfxhtyTI=s0-d-e1-ft#https://htmlsigs.s3.amazonaws.com/logos/files/000/177/391/landscape/adaptativa_256px80pxL_72dpi_SEM_SLOGAN.jpg\" alt=\"Adaptativa\" border=\"0\" height=\"62\" width=\"200\"></a></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:14px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline\">Hugo <span>Harada</s