     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Jan 21, 2019 at 10:58 PM Hugo Harada &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hugo....@adaptativa.com.br</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:small\">Hello all,</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">I am trying to write a longitudinal <span>irt</span> model like below. It has three tests applied at different times with common items across them. Theta among the different time is correlated. </div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/mirt-package/attach/168af9746ca3fd/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"462\" height=\"369\"><br></div></div><div><div style=\"font-size:small\">I wrote my mirt model like below using the constraint keyword to indicate anchor itens. </div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div>model &lt;- mirt.model(&#39; T1 = 1-30</div><div>  T2 = 31-60</div><div>  T3 = 61-90</div><div>  CONSTRAIN = (21-30, a1), (31-40, a1)</div><div>  CONSTRAIN = (21-30, d), (31-40, d)</div><div>  CONSTRAIN = (51-60, a1), (61-70, a1)</div><div>  CONSTRAIN = (51-60, d), (61-70, d)</div><div>  COV = T1*T2*T3&#39;</div><div>)</div></div></div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>Many of these constraints don&#39;t exist because they do not have freely estimated slopes. Based on the T1-T3 definitions you should see a1 parameters for items 1 through 30, a2 for items 31 to 60, and T3 for items 61 through 90. So constraints like (31-40, a1) don&#39;t work because these parameters are not freely estimated. </div><div> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div><div>mirt.2PL = mirt(U, model, itemtype = &#39;2PL&#39;)  # <span style=\"font-size:small\"></span></div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-size:small\">I get the following error. Where is my mistake? Any ideas?</div></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Error: Constraint applied to fixed parameter(s) 181 187 193 199 205 211 217 223 229 235 301 307 313 319 325 331 337 343 349 355 361 367 373 379 385 391 397 403 409 415  but should only be applied to</div><div>                 estimated parameters. Please fix!</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Looking forward to hearing from you,</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Hugo</div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473029020000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3LmHp-zh9GK4G-g0CS2Uca\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk